<title>UK: UK's FTSE 100 ends lower, tracking Dow decline.</title>
<headline>UK's FTSE 100 ends lower, tracking Dow decline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading UK shares settled lower on Thursday, tracking steep losses on Wall Street as signs of economic growth in the U.S. heightened expectations that the Federal Reserve will tighten credit later this month.</p>
<p>The benchmark FTSE 100 share index closed 24.8 points lower at 4,397.7, as decliners led advancers 68 to 29. Turnover registered 741 million shares at 1640 GMT.</p>
</text>
